<Layout title="About — Zeqing Wang" description="About Zeqing Wang's research interests and approach to research engineering.">
  <article class="about-shell">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I am Zeqing Wang, a researcher and engineer interested in computer vision and machine learning.</p>
    <p>My preferred way of working sits between research and implementation: formulate a precise question, build the smallest system that can test it, and make the result understandable and reproducible.</p>

    <h2>Research interests</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Perception:</strong> multimodal sensing, 3D understanding, and grounded world models</li>
      <li><strong>Cognition:</strong> foundation-model reasoning, planning, tool use, and persistent memory</li>
      <li><strong>Action:</strong> vision-language-action policies, skill learning, and adaptive robot control</li>
      <li><strong>Interaction:</strong> natural human–robot communication and multi-agent coordination</li>
    </ul>

    <p>A fuller academic record, including education, publications, and a downloadable CV, will be added when the material is ready for public release.</p>
